        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rita Sangalli, Louis Mérante, Léo Delibes\n- Organizations: Paris Opera Ballet\n- Works: Sylvia, Yedda, Namouna\n- Topics: ballet premieres\n\nFacts:\n- In 1876, Rita Sangalli joined the Paris Opera Ballet.\n- On 14 June 1876, Rita Sangalli performed in the premiere of Sylvia at the Paris Opera Ballet.\n- In 1876, Sylvia, originally titled Sylvia, ou La nymphe de Diane, was first choreographed by Louis Mérante to music by Léo Delibes.\n- In 1879, Rita Sangalli performed in the premiere of Yedda at the Paris Opera Ballet.\n- On 6 March 1882, Rita Sangalli performed in the premiere of Namouna at the Paris Opera Ballet.",
